# Level A of a two-map progression, for testing a per-client map change.
#
# One room and one switch, deliberately: what is under test is the SERVER
# moving a session from one simulation to another, and a map you have to
# navigate would make a failure ambiguous between "the exit did not fire" and
# "the player never reached it".
#
# The exit is side 1, the east wall, four steps from the spawn.

body radius 0.3333 height 1.1667

# What this map needs to behave. mapc copies both next to the baked map, and
# the server loads them from there -- no --script arguments required.
script scripts/doom.lua
script level_a.lua

sector floor 0 ceil 6 tag 1 light 220 floortex FLOOR4_8 ceiltex CEIL3_5
  vertex 0 0    wall tex STARTAN3
  vertex 20 0   wall tex SW1STON1
  vertex 20 20  wall tex STARTAN3
  vertex 0 20   wall tex STARTAN3
end

spawn start 16 10 1
